{
  "version": 1,
  "mappingRevision": 1,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "intro-1",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Ding-ding—the barn door swings.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-2",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Across the field, a new letter rings.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-A",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "Apple — that's A. It is a plant food that grows from a crop, vine, shrub, or tree before it is picked.",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-B",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "Spot B: Barn! A barn is a farm building that can shelter animals, hay, tools, or supplies.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-C",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "C brings Cow. Cow says moo | slow farm steps come into view",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-D",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "D? Donkey! A donkey has long ears, sturdy hooves, and a strong body used for carrying or pulling loads.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-E",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "By the barn, here is E with Ewe. Step by step | sturdy legs keep moving yet",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-F",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "Farmer — that's F. A farmer cares for crops, animals, land, and the daily work of a farm.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-G",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "Spot G: Goat! Hooves on ground | steady little steps go round",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-H",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "H brings Hay. It is cut and dried grass or other plants stored as animal feed.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-I",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "I? Ice Chest! An ice chest is an insulated box that helps food or drinks stay cold.",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-J",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "By the barn, here is J with Jar. It is a rigid container with a wide opening and a lid.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-K",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "Kernel — that's K. It is one small seed or grain, such as a kernel of corn.",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-L",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "Spot L: Ladder! A ladder has rungs between two side rails for reaching higher places; children only observe it safely.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-3-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-3",
      "text": "Ring the barn bell—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-3-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-3",
      "text": "Find the farm word, one-two-three!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-M",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "M brings Milk. It is a pale liquid food produced by mammals; on farms it is commonly collected from dairy animals.",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-N",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "N? Nectarine! Nectarine is a plant food that grows from a crop, vine, shrub, or tree before it is picked.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-O",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "By the barn, here is O with Orchard. It is a group of fruit or nut trees grown together.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-P",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "Pitchfork — that's P. It is a long-handled farm tool with several pointed tines; children only identify it from a safe distance.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Q",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Spot Q: Quail! Quail on the trail | ground bird with a little tail",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-R",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "R brings Rake. It has a long handle and a row of teeth used to gather loose material; children only identify it safely.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-S",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "S? Scarecrow! A scarecrow is a human-shaped figure placed in a field to discourage birds from feeding on crops.",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-T",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "By the barn, here is T with Tractor. It is a powerful farm vehicle built to pull or operate heavy equipment.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-U",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "Udder — that's U. It is the milk-producing organ beneath animals such as cows, goats, and sheep.",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-V",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "Spot V: Vegetable Basket! A vegetable basket holds gathered produce so it can be carried together.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-W",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "W brings Wagon. Wagon on the way | four wheels carry things today",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-X",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "X? X-ray Vet Image! An X-ray vet image lets a veterinarian see bones inside an animal without opening the body.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Y",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "By the barn, here is Y with Yam. It stores food in a thick underground tuber.",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Z",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Zebu — that's Z. It is a type of cattle with a noticeable hump over its shoulders.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-7-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-7",
      "text": "Ring the barn bell—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-7-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-7",
      "text": "Find the farm word, one-two-three!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-A",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Spot A ... Apple! Pretend to pick it gently, then show the picture.",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-B",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Remember B ... Barn! Make a roof shape with both hands.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-C",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "C? ... Cow! Tap two quiet hoof-beats with your fingers.",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-D",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Find D ... Donkey! Tap two quiet hoof-beats with your fingers.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-E",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "Spot E ... Ewe! Tap two quiet hoof-beats with your fingers.",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-F",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "Remember F ... Farmer! Point to the matching picture, then make one small shape gesture.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-G",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "G? ... Goat! Tap two quiet hoof-beats with your fingers.",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-H",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "Find H ... Hay! Spread fingers like a loose bundle of hay.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-I",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Spot I ... Ice Chest! Point to the matching picture, then make one small shape gesture.",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-J",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Remember J ... Jar! Point to the matching picture, then make one small shape gesture.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-K",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "K? ... Kernel! Point to the matching picture, then make one small shape gesture.",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-L",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Find L ... Ladder! Point to the matching picture, then make one small shape gesture.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-3-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-3",
      "text": "Ring the barn bell—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-3-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-3",
      "text": "Find the farm word, one-two-three!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-M",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Spot M ... Milk! Point to the matching picture, then make one small shape gesture.",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-N",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Remember N ... Nectarine! Pretend to pick it gently, then show the picture.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-O",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "O? ... Orchard! Point to the matching picture, then make one small shape gesture.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-P",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Find P ... Pitchfork! Point to the picture and name its job.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Q",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Spot Q ... Quail! Make tiny pecking finger taps.",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-R",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Remember R ... Rake! Point to the picture and name its job.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-S",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "S? ... Scarecrow! Stretch arms out like a scarecrow.",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-T",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Find T ... Tractor! Roll two fists slowly like big wheels.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-U",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "Spot U ... Udder! Point to the matching picture, then make one small shape gesture.",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-V",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "Remember V ... Vegetable Basket! Point to the matching picture, then make one small shape gesture.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-W",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "W? ... Wagon! Roll two hands forward like wagon wheels.",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-X",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "Find X ... X-ray Vet Image! Point to the picture and name its job.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Y",
      "sectionId": "r2-y-z",
      "text": "Spot Y ... Yam! Pretend to pick it gently, then show the picture.",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Z",
      "sectionId": "r2-y-z",
      "text": "Remember Z ... Zebu! Tap two quiet hoof-beats with your fingers.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-7-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-7",
      "text": "Ring the barn bell—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-7-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-7",
      "text": "Find the farm word, one-two-three!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "outro-1",
      "sectionId": "outro",
      "text": "Ring the barn bell—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "outro-2",
      "sectionId": "outro",
      "text": "A to Z—barn bell stays with me!",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    }
  ]
}
